   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Control (color / depth)\n\n1. Load a control adapter in the Multi-LoRA (e.g. moss-color-depth-control from\n   darask0/MOSS-Image-color-depth-control, trained on MOSS-Image Base). Keep it at 1.0:\n   ComfyUI replaces its widened video_embedder at full strength anyway.\n2. Load a depth map (near is white), e.g. from Depth Anything (comfyui_controlnet_aux).\n   MOSS Control resizes it in pixels to the latent before the VAE.\n3. color_mode: off = depth only (clothes and colors from the prompt);\n   flat regions = connect a photo to color_map, reduced to a few flat colors for the palette;\n   as given = a real segmentation map (a photo there makes the adapter copy its texture).\n4. strength 1.0 is the trained value; end_percent below 1.0 loosens the shapes at the end.\n\nNot measured yet: the adapter on SFT (this example) against Base, and with the turbo LoRAs."
   ],
   "properties": {}
  }
